title: CH1_M0_START
---
// CH1 - M0: Den KTX, nhan phong, gap ban moi, vao lop
<<set_milestone 0>>

Minh: "Toi noi roi. Gio vao hoi bac bao ve truoc." 

// Bat dau quest dau tien: hoi bac bao ve
<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_TALK_GUARD">>
===

title: CH1_M0_CHECK_EMAIL
---
// Tuong tac tuy chon: mo email nhan phong
<<switch_ui "phone">>
Minh: "Toa A, phong 308. Lam thu tuc o sanh tiep nhan."
Minh: "Can CCCD, email xac nhan, MSSV..."
<<trace TRACE_READ_RELEVANT_INFO 1>>
<<switch_ui "normal">>

// Quay ve muc tieu hoi bac bao ve
<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_TALK_GUARD">>
===

title: CH1_M0_TALK_GUARD
---
Bac bao ve: "Chau nhan phong ha?"
Minh: "Da, con moi len nhan phong a."
Bac bao ve: "Toa nao?"
Minh: "Da toa A."
Bac bao ve: "Co email xac nhan chua?"
Minh: "Da co."
Bac bao ve: "Roi, con vao sanh ben kia. Toi ban huong dan, nguoi ta chi tiep cho."
Minh: "Da, con cam on bac."

// Di vao sanh tiep nhan
<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_GO_LOBBY">>
===

title: CH1_M0_GO_LOBBY
---
// Tuong tac voi loi vao toa A / sanh tiep nhan
Minh: "Di vao sanh tiep nhan thoi."

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_TALK_LINH">>
===

title: CH1_M0_TALK_LINH
---
Chi Linh: "Em nhan phong ha?"
Minh: "Da, em ten Nguyen Minh, phong 308."
Chi Linh: "Toa A dung khong em?"
Minh: "Da dung."
Chi Linh: "Em vao van phong ben kia lam thu tuc nhan the phong nha. Chuan bi email xac nhan, CCCD voi MSSV."
Minh: "Da, em vao do luon ha chi?"
Chi Linh: "Um. Lam xong quay lai day, roi em quet ma nhom toa de nhan thong bao."
Minh: "Da, em cam on chi."

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_DO_PAPERWORK">>
<<jump CH1_M0_DO_PAPERWORK>>
===

title: CH1_M0_DO_PAPERWORK
---
// Tuong tac voi van phong tiep nhan
Minh: "Thu tuc xong roi. The phong va noi quy day du."

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_SCAN_QR">>
<<jump CH1_M0_ASK_QR>>
===

title: CH1_M0_ASK_QR
---
// Tuy chon hoi them ve nhom thong bao
Minh: "Da chi oi, nhom nay la nhom chinh thuc cua toa ha chi?"
Chi Linh: "Dung roi em. Thong bao gio giac, noi quy, bao sua do... se nhan trong nhom do."
Minh: "Da, em hieu roi."
<<trace TRACE_ASK_PERSON 2>>

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_SCAN_QR">>
===

title: CH1_M0_SCAN_QR
---
// Quet QR vao nhom toa
Minh: "Roi, xong nhom toa."
Minh: "Gio len phong 308 thoi."

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_GO_ROOM">>
<<chapter_end>>
===

title: CH1_M0_ENTER_ROOM
---
// Vao phong 308 va gap Quan, Huy
Quan: "Ong phong 308 moi vo ha?"
Minh: "Uh, tui la Minh."
Quan: "Vali ong nhin hoi chien do."
Minh: "No nghi tu cong roi."
Huy: "Em de do gon ben kia truoc. The phong voi giay to giu ky."
Huy: "Nhom toa co thong bao thi nho xem. May hom dau de sot lam."
Minh: "Da, em vua vao nhom roi anh."

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_GO_CLASS">>
===

title: CH1_M0_GO_CLASS
---
// Di den lop hoc dau tien
Minh: "Toi lop moi kip."

<<set_objective "OBJ_M0_TALK_NAM_MAI">>
===

title: CH1_M0_TALK_NAM_MAI
---
// Gap Nam va Mai o lop hoc
Nam: "Ban chua co nhom ha?"
Minh: "Chua."
Mai: "Minh lam nhom voi tui va Nam nhe."
Minh: "Ok."
Mai: "Minh tim tai lieu nen va phan mo dau nha."
Nam: "Toi lo vi du minh hoa."

// Bat dau M1: tim tai lieu
<<set_milestone 1>>
<<set_objective "OBJ_M1_OPEN_LAPTOP">>
===
